      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ……。\r\nパラデイアが繁栄したのは\r\n大地がクリスタルでできていたからじゃ。",
        "official_en": "Aye, Paladia owes its prosperity to the crystals that make up its land.",
        "real_en": "Yes. Paladia prospered because its very land was made of Crystals."
      },
